# Token used at build time to read GitHub Discussions for the comments
# section. Create a fine-grained personal access token at
# https://github.com/settings/personal-access-tokens with:
#   - Repository access: this repo only
#   - Repository permissions: Discussions = Read-only
# Then copy this file to .env and paste the token below.
#
# In CI the deploy workflow uses the auto-injected GITHUB_TOKEN instead,
# so this variable only needs to be set for local builds.
GITHUB_DISCUSSIONS_TOKEN=
